    <name>Tempo (24min)</name>
    <description>Warmup: 4min from 50% to 70% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 87% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 87% FTP | Steady: 2min @ 50% FTP | Steady: 4min @ 87% FTP | Cooldown: 4min from 50% to 70% FTP</description>
